    {
      "bbox": [
        283,
        1187,
        1767,
        1369
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "This year the annual Mayor's Trophy Game between the Yankees and Dodgers will be played on Monday evening, June 29, at the Yankee Stadium. Proceeds will again be spent on equipment for the City's young sandlot baseball players.",
