    {
      "bbox": [
        283,
        1386,
        1750,
        1818
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Last year, despite bad weather, more than 50,000 people attended the game, and the previous year more than 72,000 attended it. The net available for distribution from these two games was $165,000. We anticipate another heavy demand for tickets this year. I ask you to notify the employees of your department that reserved seats will go on sale in Room 1, City Hall, (Col. Edward C. Riekert's office) June 2. This location has been chosen largely for their convenience. I know that many of them will want to see the game and support the excellent cause for which it is played.",
      "logprob_stats": {
